  "description": "A sportier Mondial built for performance: the Mondial Gravel is designed for riders who want a versatile, performant bike that grows with them. From 700c pavement rides to off-road adventures on 650B, this bike adapts to your style. With a dropper-post-ready frame, tubeless-ready wheels, and a Shimano GRX drivetrain, it’s ready for anything you throw at it today and tomorrow.\nBUILT FOR SPEED & VERSATILITY\nSteel frame with a carbon fork and 700c wheels deliver responsive handling, comfort, and durability on pavement, gravel, or dirt. Fully compatible with 650B wheels for added traction and comfort.\nNO PROPRIETARY PARTS\nStandard components throughout. Easy to service, replace, or upgrade anywhere.\nPERFORMANCE-READY COMPONENTS\nShimano GRX RX600 1x11 drivetrain and hydraulic brakes provide reliable shifting and stopping power, plus tubeless-ready wheels for upgrade flexibility.\nCUSTOM-BUILT WHEELS\nQuality rims, Shimano hubs, and brass nipples for strength, serviceability, and confidence off-road.\nDESIGNED IN-HOUSE\nEvery Mondial bike is designed and assembled by us from start to finish.\nNO GIMMICKS\nA well-thought-out bike built for performance, durability, and fun.",
